# Built book formats.
#
# The PDF and EPUB are build outputs generated from book/chapters/*.md. They are
# attached to the GitHub Release rather than committed, because both formats are
# already-compressed archives that git cannot delta — every revision would store
# a near-complete copy and grow the repository permanently.
#
# Download links live in the README and point at /releases/latest/download/,
# which always resolves to the current build.
book/*.pdf
book/*.epub
